'''Total War: Fall Special''' (大乱闘 秋イベスペシャル ''Dai Rantō Aki Ibesupesharu'', '''Great Free-for-All: Autumn Eve Special''') is the Fall [[Total Wars|Total War]]. It is unlocked after clearing [[Old Guys About Town (Monthly Event)|Old Guys About Town]], [[Autumn = Sports Day! (Monthly Event)|Autumn = Sports Day!]] and [[Loving Labour (Monthly Event)|Loving Labor]], and contains enemies from all three events. It was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

